{
  "cells": [
    {
      "kind": 1,
      "value": "# Cocycle Tests for Spin-Field OPE",
      "languageId": "markdown"
    },
    {
      "kind": 1,
      "value": "## Setup",
      "languageId": "markdown"
    },
    {
      "kind": 2,
      "value": "ClearAll[\"Global`*\"];\n\n(*** Declaring field content - ignore everything but spinfield below ***)\n\nbosons={expX,dX,dXt,d\\[Phi],d\\[Phi]t,exp\\[Phi]b,exp\\[Phi]tb};\nfermions={\\[Psi],\\[Psi]t,b,bt,c,ct,\\[Xi],\\[Xi]t,\\[Eta],\\[Eta]t,exp\\[Phi]f,exp\\[Phi]tf};\nregbosons={spinfield,expX,dX,dXt,d\\[Phi],d\\[Phi]t,exp\\[Phi]b,exp\\[Phi]tb};\nregfermions={\\[Psi],\\[Psi]t,b,bt,c,ct,\\[Xi],\\[Xi]t,\\[Eta],\\[Eta]t};\nsimplefields={dX,dXt,d\\[Phi],d\\[Phi]t,\\[Psi],\\[Psi]t,b,bt,c,ct,\\[Xi],\\[Xi]t,\\[Eta],\\[Eta]t};\ncompositefields={spinfield,expX,exp\\[Phi]b,exp\\[Phi]tb,exp\\[Phi]f,exp\\[Phi]tf};\nallfields=Join[regbosons,regfermions];\n\npairing[pair_]:=If[MemberQ[{{spinfield,spinfield},{expX,expX},{dX,expX},{dXt,expX},{dX,dX},{dXt,dXt},{d\\[Phi],d\\[Phi]},{d\\[Phi]t,d\\[Phi]t},{exp\\[Phi]b,exp\\[Phi]b},{d\\[Phi],exp\\[Phi]b},{exp\\[Phi]bt,exp\\[Phi]bt},{d\\[Phi]t,exp\\[Phi]bt},{d\\[Phi],exp\\[Phi]f},{exp\\[Phi]f,exp\\[Phi]f},{exp\\[Phi]b,exp\\[Phi]f},{d\\[Phi]t,exp\\[Phi]tf},{exp\\[Phi]tf,exp\\[Phi]tf},{exp\\[Phi]tb,exp\\[Phi]tf},{\\[Psi],\\[Psi]},{\\[Psi]t,\\[Psi]t},{b,c},{bt,ct},{\\[Eta],\\[Xi]},{\\[Eta]t,\\[Xi]t}},Sort[pair]],1,0]\n\n\n(*** preparing for computing Wick contraction between spin fields ***)\n\nLDot[spin1_,spin2_]:=Module[{i},-spin1[[1]] spin2[[1]]+Sum[spin1[[i]] spin2[[i]],{i,2,Length[spin1]}]]/;Length[spin1]==Length[spin2]\n\nMWick[spinfield[spin1_,z1_],spinfield[spin2_,z2_]]:=cocycle[spin1,spin2] BranchPower[z1-z2,LDot[spin1,spin2]]\n\nMWick[R[a_],R[b_]]:=MWick[a,b]\n\n(*** BranchPower is meant to keep track of branch in taking fractional powers ***)\n\nBranchPower[z_,n_]:=z^n/;IntegerQ[n]\n\n(*** The cocycle phase is captured by the set of real constants x[i,j] ***)\n\ncocycle[a_,b_]:=Module[{i,j},E^(I Pi Sum[x[i,j] a[[i]] b[[j]],{i,1,Length[a]},{j,1,Length[a]}])]/;( Length[a]==Length[b])\n\n\n(*** R stands for normal ordered product of spinfields ***)\n\nRtest[f_]:=(Head[f]==R)\nRlength[f_]:=If[Rtest[f],Length[List @@ f],0]\nRone[f_]:=(Rlength[f]==1)\n\nregcomm[f_,g_]:=1(*(-1)^(parity[f] parity[g])(-1)^(exp\\[Phi]parity[f] exp\\[Phi]parity[g])(-1)^(exp\\[Phi]tparity[f] exp\\[Phi]tparity[g])*)\n\nR[c___,b_,a_,d___]:=regcomm[a,b] R[c,a,b,d]/;(!OrderedQ[{b,a}])\nR[ c___,a_,a_,d___]:=0/;(regparity[a]==1)\n\nR[c___,a_+b_,d___]:=R[c,a,d]+R[c,b,d]\nR[c___,a_ f_,d___]:=a R[c,f,d]/;(And @@(FreeQ[a,#]&/@ allfields))\nR[c___,a_ ,d___]:=a R[c,d]/;(And @@(FreeQ[a,#]&/@ allfields))\n\nR[]:=1\nR[a___,R[b___],c___]:=R[a,b,c]\nOPE[a___,0,b___]:=0\n\nR[g___,a_ f_,h___]:=R[g,a,f,h]/;MemberQ[regbosons,Head[a]]\nR[g___,a_^n_ f_,h___]:=R[g,(R @@ ConstantArray[a,n]),f,h]/;MemberQ[regbosons,Head[a]]\nR[g___,a_^n_,h___]:=R[g,(R @@ ConstantArray[a,n]),h]/;MemberQ[regbosons,Head[a]]\n\nR[ c___,a_,a_,d___]:=R[c,spinfield[2a[[1]],a[[2]]],d]/;(Head[a]==spinfield)\nR[ c___,a_,b_,d___]:=R[c,spinfield[a[[1]]+b[[1]],a[[2]]],d]/;(Head[a]==spinfield && Head[b]==spinfield && a[[2]]==b[[2]])\n\n(*** defining OPE between normal ordered expressions involving spin fields ***)\n\nOPE[Ra_,Rb_]:= If[pairing[{Head[Ra[[1]]],Head[Rb[[1]]]}]==1, MWick[Ra,Rb],1]  R[Ra,Rb]/;(Rone[Ra] && Rone[Rb] && MemberQ[compositefields,Head[Ra[[1]]]] && MemberQ[compositefields,Head[Rb[[1]]]])\n\nDWick[Ra_,Rb_]:=  If[pairing[{Head[Ra[[1]]],Head[Rb[[1]]]}]==1,  MWick[Ra,Rb],1] Rb/;(Rone[Ra] && Rone[Rb] && MemberQ[compositefields,Head[Ra[[1]]]] && MemberQ[compositefields,Head[Rb[[1]]]])\n\nDWick[Ra_,Rb_]:=  If[pairing[{Head[Ra[[1]]],Head[Rb[[1]]]}]==1,  MWick[Ra[[1]],Rb[[1]]],1] R[Rb[[1]],DWick[Ra,(R @@ (Drop[(List @@ Rb),1]))]]/;(Rone[Ra] && Rtest[Rb] &&(!Rone[Rb]) && MemberQ[compositefields,Head[Ra[[1]]]] && MemberQ[compositefields,Head[Rb[[1]]]])\n\nOPE[Ra_,Rb_]:= R[Ra,DWick[R[Ra[[1]]],Rb]]/;(Rone[Ra] && Rtest[Rb]  && MemberQ[compositefields,Head[Ra[[1]]]] )\n\nOPE[Ra_,Rb_]:=R[R[Ra[[1]]],OPE[(R @@ (Drop[(List @@ Ra),1])),DWick[R[Ra[[1]]],Rb]]]/;(Rtest[Ra] && Rtest[Rb] &&(!Rone[Ra]) && MemberQ[compositefields,Head[Ra[[1]]]] )\n\nOPE[f_,g_]:=f g/;((And @@(FreeQ[f,#]&/@ allfields))||(And @@(FreeQ[g,#]&/@ allfields)))\nOPE[a_+b_,c_]:=OPE[a,c]+OPE[b,c]\nOPE[c_,a_+b_]:=OPE[c,a]+OPE[c,b]\nOPE[a_ b_,c_]:=a OPE[b,c]/;(And @@(FreeQ[a,#]&/@ allfields))\nOPE[ b_,a_ c_]:=a OPE[b,c]/;(And @@(FreeQ[a,#]&/@ allfields))\n\nOPE[c__,a_,b_]:=OPE[c,OPE[a,b]]",
      "languageId": "wolfram"
    },
    {
      "kind": 2,
      "value": "spinfield[{0,0,0,0,0,0},z_]:=1\n\nSpic[pic_,spins_,z_]:=spinfield[Join[{pic},spins],z]\n\n(*** spin assignment for the chiral and anti-chiral spinor representation ***)\nchiralspins=Join[{{(1)/(2),(1)/(2),(1)/(2),(1)/(2),(1)/(2)}},Permutations[{(1)/(2),(1)/(2),(1)/(2),-(1)/(2),-(1)/(2)}],Permutations[{(1)/(2),-(1)/(2),-(1)/(2),-(1)/(2),-(1)/(2)}]];\nantichiralspins=-chiralspins;\n\n(*** spin assignment for the vector representation ***)\nvectors=Join[Permutations[{1,0,0,0,0}],Permutations[{-1,0,0,0,0}]];\n\n(*** what turns out to be a consistent assignment of cocycle phase coefficients ***)\nx[i_,i_]:=0\nx[i_,j_]:=-x[j,i]/;i<j\nx[i_,j_]:=(-1)^(i j)/2/;i>j && j!=1\nx[i_,1]:=1/2/;i>1\n(*** this is a key result of this notebook ***)",
      "languageId": "wolfram"
    },
    {
      "kind": 1,
      "value": "## Helper Predicates and Test Utilities",
      "languageId": "markdown"
    },
    {
      "kind": 2,
      "value": "ClearAll[\n  halfIntegerQ,\n  gsoProjectedQ,\n  rSectorQ,\n  nsSectorQ,\n  assocResidual,\n  nonZeroPairQ,\n  gradedSignCheck,\n  runSuite,\n  extractGammaMatrices,\n  proportionalityCheck,\n  withShift,\n  toOp,\n  firstNonZeroIndex,\n  makePairs\n];\n\nhalfIntegerQ[x_] := IntegerQ[2 x] && !IntegerQ[x];\n\ngsoProjectedQ[spinVec_] := IntegerQ[Total[spinVec]] && EvenQ[Total[spinVec]];\nrSectorQ[spinVec_] := And @@ (halfIntegerQ /@ spinVec);\nnsSectorQ[spinVec_] := And @@ (IntegerQ /@ spinVec);\n\nassocResidual[a_, b_, c_] := Simplify[OPE[OPE[a, b], c] - OPE[a, OPE[b, c]]];\n\nnonZeroPairQ[a_, b_] := Module[{ab, ba},\n  ab = Simplify[OPE[a, b]];\n  ba = Simplify[OPE[R[b[[1]]], R[a[[1]]]]];\n  ab =!= 0 && ba =!= 0\n];\n\ngradedSignCheck[a_, b_, expectedSign_] := Module[{ab, ba},\n  ab = Simplify[OPE[a, b]];\n  ba = Simplify[OPE[R[b[[1]]], R[a[[1]]]]];\n  If[ab === 0 || ba === 0, False, TrueQ[Simplify[ab/ba == expectedSign]]]\n];\n\nrunSuite[name_, cases_, testFn_] := Module[{results, failed},\n  results = MapIndexed[\n    Function[{entry, idx},\n      Module[{out, ok},\n        out = Quiet @ Check[testFn[entry], $Failed];\n        ok = TrueQ[out];\n        <|\n          \"index\" -> idx[[1]],\n          \"ok\" -> ok,\n          \"case\" -> entry,\n          \"detail\" -> If[ok, \"\", out]\n        |>\n      ]\n    ],\n    cases\n  ];\n  failed = Select[results, !TrueQ[#ok] &];\n  <|\n    \"name\" -> name,\n    \"total\" -> Length[cases],\n    \"passed\" -> Count[results[[All, \"ok\"]], True],\n    \"failed\" -> Length[failed],\n    \"failures\" -> Take[failed, UpTo[5]]\n  |>\n];\n\nextractGammaMatrices[pVec_, pSpin_, basisIn_, pOut_, basisOut_, zPower_] := Module[\n  {rawMats, transformed},\n  rawMats = Table[\n    Table[\n      Simplify[\n        Coefficient[\n          Coefficient[\n            OPE[R[Spic[pVec, vectors[[vec]], z]], R[Spic[pSpin, basisIn[[a]], 0]]],\n            z,\n            zPower\n          ] /. z -> 0,\n          R[Spic[pOut, basisOut[[b]], 0]]\n        ]\n      ],\n      {a, 1, Length[basisIn]},\n      {b, 1, Length[basisOut]}\n    ],\n    {vec, 1, Length[vectors]}\n  ];\n  transformed = Table[\n    Simplify[Sum[M[[mu, vec]] rawMats[[vec]], {vec, 1, Length[vectors]}]],\n    {mu, 1, Length[vectors]}\n  ];\n  transformed\n];\n\nproportionalityCheck[mats_, gammaFamily_] := Module[\n  {perMu, coeffs, uniformQ},\n  perMu = Table[\n    Module[{gamma, ratios, mismatch, cVal, pass},\n      gamma = gammaFamily[mu];\n      ratios = {};\n      mismatch = False;\n      Do[\n        If[TrueQ[Simplify[gamma[[i, j]] == 0]],\n          If[!TrueQ[Simplify[mats[[mu, i, j]] == 0]], mismatch = True],\n          ratios = Append[ratios, Simplify[mats[[mu, i, j]]/gamma[[i, j]]]]\n        ],\n        {i, 1, Length[gamma]},\n        {j, 1, Length[gamma[[1]]]}]\n      ;\n      If[mismatch || Length[ratios] == 0,\n        <|\"mu\" -> mu, \"pass\" -> False, \"coefficient\" -> Missing[\"NoProportionality\"]|>,\n        cVal = First[ratios];\n        pass = And @@ (TrueQ[Simplify[# == cVal]] & /@ ratios);\n        <|\"mu\" -> mu, \"pass\" -> pass, \"coefficient\" -> cVal|>\n      ]\n    ],\n    {mu, 1, Length[mats]}\n  ];\n  coeffs = perMu[[All, \"coefficient\"]];\n  uniformQ = If[\n    AllTrue[coeffs, !MatchQ[#, _Missing] &],\n    And @@ Table[TrueQ[Simplify[coeffs[[i]] == coeffs[[1]]]], {i, 2, Length[coeffs]}],\n    False\n  ];\n  <|\n    \"allMuPass\" -> AllTrue[perMu[[All, \"pass\"]], TrueQ],\n    \"uniformCoefficientQ\" -> uniformQ,\n    \"coefficients\" -> coeffs,\n    \"details\" -> perMu\n  |>\n];\n\nwithShift[spin6_, compIndex_, delta_] := ReplacePart[spin6, compIndex -> spin6[[compIndex]] + delta];\n\ntoOp[spin6_, coord_] := R[spinfield[spin6, coord]];\n\nfirstNonZeroIndex[v_] := First @ FirstPosition[Abs[v], _?(# > 0 &)];\n\nmakePairs[candsA_, candsB_, coordA_, coordB_, n_] := Module[{pairs, i, j, a, b},\n  pairs = {};\n  i = 1;\n  While[i <= Length[candsA] && Length[pairs] < n,\n    j = 1;\n    While[j <= Length[candsB] && Length[pairs] < n,\n      a = toOp[candsA[[i]], coordA];\n      b = toOp[candsB[[j]], coordB];\n      If[nonZeroPairQ[a, b], pairs = Append[pairs, {candsA[[i]], candsB[[j]]}]];\n      j = j + 1;\n    ];\n    i = i + 1;\n  ];\n  pairs\n];",
      "languageId": "wolfram"
    },
    {
      "kind": 1,
      "value": "## Deterministic Operator Pools",
      "languageId": "markdown"
    },
    {
      "kind": 2,
      "value": "rBaseSpin6 = Join[\n  Table[Join[{-1/2}, chiralspins[[i]]], {i, 1, Length[chiralspins]}],\n  Table[Join[{-1/2}, antichiralspins[[i]]], {i, 1, Length[antichiralspins]}]\n];\n\nrExcitedSpin6 = DeleteDuplicates @ Join[\n  Table[withShift[rBaseSpin6[[i]], 2 + Mod[i - 1, 5], 1], {i, 1, Min[20, Length[rBaseSpin6]]}],\n  Table[withShift[rBaseSpin6[[i]], 2 + Mod[i, 5], 2], {i, 1, Min[10, Length[rBaseSpin6]]}],\n  Table[withShift[rBaseSpin6[[i]], 2 + Mod[i + 1, 5], -1], {i, 1, Min[20, Length[rBaseSpin6]]}],\n  Table[ReplacePart[rBaseSpin6[[i]], 1 -> -3/2], {i, 1, Min[12, Length[rBaseSpin6]]}],\n  Table[ReplacePart[rBaseSpin6[[i]], 1 -> 1/2], {i, 1, Min[12, Length[rBaseSpin6]]}]\n];\n\nnsBaseSpin6 = Table[Join[{-1}, vectors[[i]]], {i, 1, Length[vectors]}];\n\nnsExcitedSpin6 = DeleteDuplicates @ Join[\n  Table[\n    Module[{idx = firstNonZeroIndex[vectors[[i]]]},\n      withShift[Join[{-1}, vectors[[i]]], idx + 1, 2 Sign[vectors[[i, idx]]]]\n    ],\n    {i, 1, Length[vectors]}\n  ],\n  Table[\n    Module[{idx = firstNonZeroIndex[vectors[[i]]]},\n      withShift[Join[{1}, vectors[[i]]], idx + 1, 2 Sign[vectors[[i, idx]]]]\n    ],\n    {i, 1, Length[vectors]}\n  ],\n  Table[Join[{1}, vectors[[i]]], {i, 1, Length[vectors]}]\n];\n\nrCandidates = Select[\n  DeleteDuplicates @ Join[rBaseSpin6, rExcitedSpin6],\n  rSectorQ[#] && gsoProjectedQ[#] &\n];\n\nnsCandidates = Select[\n  DeleteDuplicates @ Join[nsBaseSpin6, nsExcitedSpin6],\n  nsSectorQ[#] && gsoProjectedQ[#] &\n];\n\nassocStatePool = Sort @ DeleteDuplicates @ Join[\n  Take[rCandidates, UpTo[20]],\n  Take[nsCandidates, UpTo[20]],\n  Take[Select[rCandidates, Max[Abs[Rest[#]]] > 1/2 &], UpTo[10]],\n  Take[Select[nsCandidates, Max[Abs[Rest[#]]] > 1/2 &], UpTo[10]]\n];\n\npoolDiagnostics = <|\n  \"rCandidates\" -> Length[rCandidates],\n  \"nsCandidates\" -> Length[nsCandidates],\n  \"excitedRIncludedQ\" -> AnyTrue[rCandidates, Max[Abs[Rest[#]]] > 1/2 &],\n  \"excitedNSIncludedQ\" -> AnyTrue[nsCandidates, Max[Abs[Rest[#]]] > 1/2 &],\n  \"containsR3Over2Or5Over2Q\" -> AnyTrue[rCandidates, AnyTrue[Abs[#], (# == 3/2 || # == 5/2) &] &]\n|>;\n\npoolDiagnostics",
      "languageId": "wolfram"
    },
    {
      "kind": 1,
      "value": "## Associativity Suite",
      "languageId": "markdown"
    },
    {
      "kind": 2,
      "value": "assocSeedStates = Take[assocStatePool, UpTo[18]];\n\nassocGenerated = Reap[\n  Do[\n    Module[{tripleStates, a, b, c, lhs, rhs},\n      tripleStates = {\n        assocSeedStates[[1 + Mod[n, Length[assocSeedStates]]]],\n        assocSeedStates[[1 + Mod[2 n + 3, Length[assocSeedStates]]]],\n        assocSeedStates[[1 + Mod[3 n + 5, Length[assocSeedStates]]]]\n      };\n      a = toOp[tripleStates[[1]], u];\n      b = toOp[tripleStates[[2]], z];\n      c = toOp[tripleStates[[3]], w];\n      lhs = Simplify[OPE[OPE[a, b], c]];\n      rhs = Simplify[OPE[a, OPE[b, c]]];\n      If[lhs =!= 0 || rhs =!= 0, Sow[tripleStates]];\n    ],\n    {n, 0, 800}\n  ]\n][[2, 1]];\n\nassocTriples = Take[DeleteDuplicates[assocGenerated], UpTo[30]];\n\nIf[Length[assocTriples] < 30,\n  assocTriples = Join[\n    assocTriples,\n    Take[\n      DeleteDuplicates[\n        Table[\n          {\n            assocSeedStates[[1 + Mod[m, Length[assocSeedStates]]]],\n            assocSeedStates[[1 + Mod[3 m + 1, Length[assocSeedStates]]]],\n            assocSeedStates[[1 + Mod[5 m + 2, Length[assocSeedStates]]]]\n          },\n          {m, 0, 200}\n        ]\n      ],\n      30 - Length[assocTriples]\n    ]\n  ];\n];\n\nassocTriples = Take[assocTriples, UpTo[30]];\n\nassocSuite = runSuite[\n  \"Associativity (>=30 requested)\",\n  assocTriples,\n  Function[triple,\n    Module[{a, b, c, residual},\n      a = toOp[triple[[1]], u];\n      b = toOp[triple[[2]], z];\n      c = toOp[triple[[3]], w];\n      residual = assocResidual[a, b, c];\n      TrueQ[Simplify[residual == 0]]\n    ]\n  ]\n];\n\nassocSuite",
      "languageId": "wolfram"
    },
    {
      "kind": 1,
      "value": "## R-Sector Anticommutation Suite",
      "languageId": "markdown"
    },
    {
      "kind": 2,
      "value": "rPairs = makePairs[rCandidates, rCandidates, z, w, 10];\n\nrSuite = runSuite[\n  \"R-sector anticommutation (10)\",\n  rPairs,\n  Function[pair,\n    gradedSignCheck[toOp[pair[[1]], z], toOp[pair[[2]], w], -1]\n  ]\n];\n\nrSuite",
      "languageId": "wolfram"
    },
    {
      "kind": 1,
      "value": "## NS-Sector Commutation Suite",
      "languageId": "markdown"
    },
    {
      "kind": 2,
      "value": "nsPairs = makePairs[nsCandidates, nsCandidates, z, w, 10];\n\nnsSuite = runSuite[\n  \"NS-sector commutation (10)\",\n  nsPairs,\n  Function[pair,\n    gradedSignCheck[toOp[pair[[1]], z], toOp[pair[[2]], w], 1]\n  ]\n];\n\nnsSuite",
      "languageId": "wolfram"
    },
    {
      "kind": 1,
      "value": "## R/NS Mutual Commutation Suite",
      "languageId": "markdown"
    },
    {
      "kind": 2,
      "value": "mixedPairs = makePairs[rCandidates, nsCandidates, z, w, 10];\n\nmixedSuite = runSuite[\n  \"R/NS mutual commutation (10)\",\n  mixedPairs,\n  Function[pair,\n    gradedSignCheck[toOp[pair[[1]], z], toOp[pair[[2]], w], 1]\n  ]\n];\n\nmixedSuite",
      "languageId": "wolfram"
    },
    {
      "kind": 1,
      "value": "## Gamma Construction Prerequisites",
      "languageId": "markdown"
    },
    {
      "kind": 2,
      "value": "(*** SSOPE stands for the OPE between a pair of chiral spin fields in -1/2 picture ***)\nSSOPE=Coefficient[Table[OPE[R[Spic[-1/2,chiralspins[[i]],z]],R[Spic[-1/2,chiralspins[[j]],0]]],{i,1,16},{j,1,16}],1/z]/.z->0;\n\n(*** AAOPE stands for the OPE between a pair of anti-chiral spin fields in -1/2 picture ***)\n\nAAOPE=Coefficient[Table[OPE[R[Spic[-1/2,antichiralspins[[i]],z]],R[Spic[-1/2,antichiralspins[[j]],0]]],{i,1,16},{j,1,16}],1/z]/.z->0;\n\n(*** Coefficient of e^-\\[Phi] in the OPE between a pair of chiral and anti-chiral spin fields; this amounts to the charge conjugation matrix up to an overall phase \\[ExponentialE]^(\\[ImaginaryI] \\[Pi])/(4) or \\[ExponentialE]^-(\\[ImaginaryI] \\[Pi])/(4) ***)\nSAPairing=(Coefficient[Table[OPE[R[Spic[-1/2,chiralspins[[i]],z]],R[Spic[-1/2,antichiralspins[[j]],0]]],{i,1,16},{j,1,16}],BranchPower[z,-(3)/(2)]]/.z->0)/R[spinfield[{-1,0,0,0,0,0},0]]\nASPairing=(Coefficient[Table[OPE[R[Spic[-1/2,antichiralspins[[i]],z]],R[Spic[-1/2,chiralspins[[j]],0]]],{i,1,16},{j,1,16}],BranchPower[z,-(3)/(2)]]/.z->0)/R[spinfield[{-1,0,0,0,0,0},0]]",
      "languageId": "wolfram"
    },
    {
      "kind": 2,
      "value": "(*** diagonalizing the translation basis ***)\n\nVectorPairing=(-1)*(Coefficient[Table[OPE[R[Spic[-1,vectors[[i]],z]],R[Spic[-1,vectors[[j]],0]]],{i,1,10},{j,1,10}],1/z^2]/.z->0)/R[spinfield[{-2,0,0,0,0,0},0]];\n\n(*** extra (-1) due to e^-\\[Phi] anti-commuting with \\[Psi]^\\[Mu] ***)\n\nM={{(1)/(Sqrt[2]),0,0,0,0,(1)/(Sqrt[2]),0,0,0,0},{0,(1)/(Sqrt[2]),0,0,0,0,(1)/(Sqrt[2]),0,0,0},{0,0,(1)/(Sqrt[2]),0,0,0,0,(1)/(Sqrt[2]),0,0},{0,0,0,(1)/(Sqrt[2]),0,0,0,0,(1)/(Sqrt[2]),0},{0,0,0,0,(1)/(Sqrt[2]),0,0,0,0,(1)/(Sqrt[2])},{(\\[ImaginaryI])/(Sqrt[2]),0,0,0,0,-(\\[ImaginaryI])/(Sqrt[2]),0,0,0,0},{0,(\\[ImaginaryI])/(Sqrt[2]),0,0,0,0,-(\\[ImaginaryI])/(Sqrt[2]),0,0,0},{0,0,(\\[ImaginaryI])/(Sqrt[2]),0,0,0,0,-(\\[ImaginaryI])/(Sqrt[2]),0,0},{0,0,0,(\\[ImaginaryI])/(Sqrt[2]),0,0,0,0,-(\\[ImaginaryI])/(Sqrt[2]),0},{0,0,0,0,(\\[ImaginaryI])/(Sqrt[2]),0,0,0,0,-(\\[ImaginaryI])/(Sqrt[2])}};\nM.VectorPairing.Transpose[M]//MatrixForm",
      "languageId": "wolfram"
    },
    {
      "kind": 2,
      "value": "Do[GammaRMS[i]=Sqrt[2]Coefficient[SSOPE, R[Spic[-1, vectors[[i]], 0]]].Inverse[RSAPairing],{i,1,10}]",
      "languageId": "wolfram"
    },
    {
      "kind": 2,
      "value": "Do[GammaRMA[i]=Sqrt[2]Coefficient[ Coefficient[\n  Table[OPE[R[Spic[-3/2, antichiralspins[[i]], z]], R[Spic[-3/2, antichiralspins[[j]], 0]]], {i, 1, 16}, {j, 1, 16}],\n  z,\n  -3\n] /. z -> 0,R[Spic[-3,vectors[[i]],0]]].Inverse[RASPairing],{i,1,10}]",
      "languageId": "wolfram"
    },
    {
      "kind": 2,
      "value": "antichiralspins",
      "languageId": "wolfram"
    },
    {
      "kind": 2,
      "value": "vectors",
      "languageId": "wolfram"
    },
    {
      "kind": 2,
      "value": "chiralspins",
      "languageId": "wolfram"
    },
    {
      "kind": 2,
      "value": "RASPairing = (Coefficient[Table[OPE[R[Spic[-3/2,antichiralspins[[i]],z]],R[Spic[-1/2,chiralspins[[j]],0]]],{i,1,16},{j,1,16}],BranchPower[z,-2]]/.z->0)/R[spinfield[{-2,0,0,0,0,0},0]];",
      "languageId": "wolfram"
    },
    {
      "kind": 2,
      "value": "RSAPairing= (Coefficient[Table[OPE[R[Spic[-1/2,chiralspins[[i]],z]],R[Spic[-3/2,antichiralspins[[j]],0]]],{i,1,16},{j,1,16}],BranchPower[z,-2]]/.z->0)/R[spinfield[{-2,0,0,0,0,0},0]];",
      "languageId": "wolfram"
    },
    {
      "kind": 2,
      "value": "Do[GammaRS[i]=Sum[Inverse[M][[j,i]]GammaRMS[j],{j,1,10}],{i,1,10}]\nDo[GammaRA[i]=Sum[Inverse[M][[j,i]]GammaRMA[j],{j,1,10}],{i,1,10}]",
      "languageId": "wolfram"
    },
    {
      "kind": 2,
      "value": "(Table[GammaRS[i].GammaRA[j]+GammaRS[j].GammaRA[i]-2 KroneckerDelta[i,j]IdentityMatrix[16] == 0 IdentityMatrix[16],{i,1,10},{j,1,10}]//Simplify)",
      "languageId": "wolfram"
    },
    {
      "kind": 2,
      "value": "(Table[GammaRA[i].GammaRS[j]+GammaRA[j].GammaRS[i]-2 KroneckerDelta[i,j]IdentityMatrix[16] == 0 IdentityMatrix[16],{i,1,10},{j,1,10}]//Simplify)",
      "languageId": "wolfram"
    },
    {
      "kind": 1,
      "value": "## Selected Gamma OPE Proportionality Checks",
      "languageId": "markdown"
    },
    {
      "kind": 2,
      "value": "gammaCheck1Mats = extractGammaMatrices[-1, -1/2, chiralspins, -3/2, antichiralspins, -1];\ngammaCheck1 = proportionalityCheck[gammaCheck1Mats, GammaRS];\n\ngammaCheck2Mats = extractGammaMatrices[1, -1/2, chiralspins, 1/2, antichiralspins, 0];\ngammaCheck2 = proportionalityCheck[gammaCheck2Mats, GammaRS];\n\ngammaCheck3Mats = extractGammaMatrices[-1, 1/2, antichiralspins, -1/2, chiralspins, 0];\ngammaCheck3 = proportionalityCheck[gammaCheck3Mats, GammaRA];\n\ngammaCheck4Mats = extractGammaMatrices[1, -3/2, antichiralspins, -1/2, chiralspins, 1];\ngammaCheck4 = proportionalityCheck[gammaCheck4Mats, GammaRA];\n\ngammaCheckSummary = Dataset[{\n  <|\"check\" -> \"e^{-phi} psi^mu with e^{-phi/2} S^alpha\", \"allMuPass\" -> gammaCheck1[\"allMuPass\"], \"uniformCoefficientQ\" -> gammaCheck1[\"uniformCoefficientQ\"], \"coefficients\" -> gammaCheck1[\"coefficients\"]|>,\n  <|\"check\" -> \"e^{phi} psi^mu with e^{-phi/2} S^alpha\", \"allMuPass\" -> gammaCheck2[\"allMuPass\"], \"uniformCoefficientQ\" -> gammaCheck2[\"uniformCoefficientQ\"], \"coefficients\" -> gammaCheck2[\"coefficients\"]|>,\n  <|\"check\" -> \"e^{-phi} psi^mu with e^{phi/2} S^{dot alpha}\", \"allMuPass\" -> gammaCheck3[\"allMuPass\"], \"uniformCoefficientQ\" -> gammaCheck3[\"uniformCoefficientQ\"], \"coefficients\" -> gammaCheck3[\"coefficients\"]|>,\n  <|\"check\" -> \"e^{phi} psi^mu with e^{-3/2 phi} S^{dot alpha}\", \"allMuPass\" -> gammaCheck4[\"allMuPass\"], \"uniformCoefficientQ\" -> gammaCheck4[\"uniformCoefficientQ\"], \"coefficients\" -> gammaCheck4[\"coefficients\"]|>\n}];\n\ngammaCheckSummary",
      "languageId": "wolfram"
    },
    {
      "kind": 1,
      "value": "## Summary",
      "languageId": "markdown"
    },
    {
      "kind": 2,
      "value": "coreSuites = {assocSuite, rSuite, nsSuite, mixedSuite};\n\ncoreSuiteSummary = Dataset[coreSuites[[All, {\"name\", \"total\", \"passed\", \"failed\"}]]];\n\nallCoreChecksPassed = AllTrue[coreSuites[[All, \"failed\"]], # == 0 &];\nallGammaChecksPassed = And @@ {\n  gammaCheck1[\"allMuPass\"],\n  gammaCheck2[\"allMuPass\"],\n  gammaCheck3[\"allMuPass\"],\n  gammaCheck4[\"allMuPass\"]\n};\n\ngammaCoefficientSummary = <|\n  \"check1\" -> If[gammaCheck1[\"uniformCoefficientQ\"], First[gammaCheck1[\"coefficients\"]], gammaCheck1[\"coefficients\"]],\n  \"check2\" -> If[gammaCheck2[\"uniformCoefficientQ\"], First[gammaCheck2[\"coefficients\"]], gammaCheck2[\"coefficients\"]],\n  \"check3\" -> If[gammaCheck3[\"uniformCoefficientQ\"], First[gammaCheck3[\"coefficients\"]], gammaCheck3[\"coefficients\"]],\n  \"check4\" -> If[gammaCheck4[\"uniformCoefficientQ\"], First[gammaCheck4[\"coefficients\"]], gammaCheck4[\"coefficients\"]]\n|>;\n\nallChecksPassed = allCoreChecksPassed && allGammaChecksPassed;\n\nfinalSummary = <|\n  \"allCoreChecksPassed\" -> allCoreChecksPassed,\n  \"allGammaChecksPassed\" -> allGammaChecksPassed,\n  \"allChecksPassed\" -> allChecksPassed,\n  \"poolDiagnostics\" -> poolDiagnostics,\n  \"suiteCounts\" -> coreSuites[[All, {\"name\", \"total\", \"passed\", \"failed\"}]],\n  \"gammaCoefficientSummary\" -> gammaCoefficientSummary\n|>;\n\ncoreSuiteSummary\ngammaCheckSummary\nfinalSummary",
      "languageId": "wolfram"
    }
  ]
}